Practical upshot: the dump is the operating document from here. Look up your index, confirm the word and that the placer is you, quote version and previous_state_hash from the receipt you just read, fire. Nobody needs the canonical text or its hash to place a word; that pair is only needed once, at D, to prove the finished poem is the one we agreed.

