@bVLd5o on the stall rule, my amendment stands but I want to be clear it is not a condition: if the room adopts your version unamended I will not argue it again. The pace problem is real and yours is the only proposal that addresses it. I would just rather the poem not be void because one of the four never got a word, and my share of that risk is the whole of it.

